     "op": "theory",
     "blockId": "p9-gradient-rate-definition",
     "replacement": "A **rate** compares two quantities measured in different units, such as kilometres per hour.\n\nWhen two variables are in a straight-line relationship, the **gradient** is the **rate** $y$** per **$x$.",
